    "changelog1601Title": "1/3 Auto-Play when selecting loops or navigating between them",
    "changelog1601Description": "In the song settings you can now enable or disable the automatic playback of loops and the entire song.",
    "changelog1602Title": "2/3 Improved loop control",
    "changelog1602Description": "You can now jump to the next or previous loop by tapping the previous or next button. Also in the notification and lock screen.",
    "changelog1603Title": "3/3 Layout adjustments",
    "changelog1603Description": "The layout of the app has been adjusted to improve the user experience.",
    "changelog150Title": "Enorme Improvement of Audio Quality at Speed Changes",
    "changelog150Description": "The audio quality at speed changes has been significantly improved. This allows for a better playback of loops with different speeds.",
    "changelog140Title": "1/2 Export Loops",
    "changelog140Description": "You can now export loops with different formats and quality.",
    "changelog1402Title": "2/2 Bug Fixes & Design Optimizations",
    "changelog1402Description": "Several Bugs were fixed and design optimized.",
    "changelog130Title": "Change tempo based on BPM",
    "changelog130Description": "You can now change the tempo of the song based on the BPM. This allows for precise tempo adjustments. Additionally, the tempo can now be reset with a button.",
    "changelog1201Title": "1/4 Added media data for audio files",
    "changelog1201Description": "The app now shows the media data for audio files. This includes the title and artist for now.",
    "changelog1202Title": "2/4 Convert m4a to mp3",
    "changelog1202Description": "The app now converts m4a files (which is currently not a supported format by the app) to mp3 files.",
    "changelog1203Title": "3/4 Delete single songs",
    "changelog1203Description": "You can now delete a song by sliding it to the left and tapping 'Delete Song'. This will delete the song and all attached loops.",
    "changelog1204Title": "4/4 Changed audio format",
    "changelog1204Description": "The audio format was changed to a more standard format and loops can be edited more precisely now.",
    "changelog115Title": "Fixed several bugs",
    "changelog115Description": "If no loop end was set, the loop would play until the end of the song and consider the song end as the loop end. Audio background service will now stop when the app is closed.",
    "changelog110Title": "Audio now plays in background and standby",
    "changelog110Description": "The audio files now play even when the app goes to the background or the phone goes into standby mode.",
    "changelog1017Title": "Reorder Loops",
    "changelog1017Description": "You can now reorder your loops by dragging and dropping them. Just long press on a loop and drag it to the new position.",
    "changelog1013Title": "Feature Voting & Feature proposal now possible",
    "changelog1013Description": "You can now vote for new features or submit your own feature proposals in the app. Just open the menu and open the 'Vote for Features' board. Happy to hear your wishes!",
